@startuml 05b-seq
' 图 05B：evaluation 执行时序 — admitRun → executeAttempt → score → decision。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #77716B
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F3EC

title 图 05B · Evaluation 执行时序：claim → plan → run → score → decision
caption <color:#6E6963>案例 evaluation.c1 replay determinism。budget: reserve-before, reconcile-after。抽象 05H。</color>

mainframe <b>评估纪律</b> · NEVER write runtime · budget fail-closed · retry = new attempt
hide footbox

box "Evaluator / Operator" #F5F1EB
  actor "Operator" as Op
end box

box "EvaluationEngine · execution/" #E5EDE5
  control "EvaluationEngine" as Eng
  control "RunStateMachine" as RSM
end box

box "E6 Scoring / Review" #EDE8F0
  control "MetricObservation" as Score
  control "ClaimDecision" as Dec
end box

box "Ports / Adapters" #E8EEF5
  database "RunStore" as Store
  database "BudgetLedger" as Bud
  control "CandidateRunner" as Runner
  control "ConformanceCertificateResolver" as Cert
end box

box "External (read-only)" #E5ECEE
  participant "@cantilune/conformance" as Conf
  participant "@cantilune/runtime (optional)" as RT
end box

== E4 · admitRun ==

Op -> Eng : admitRun(plan, candidateSubject, budgetPolicy)
activate Eng
Eng -> Cert : resolve(packageConformanceCertificateRef)
Cert -> Conf : read C9 certificate
Conf --> Cert : valid · unexpired · not revoked
Eng -> Bud : reserveBudget(estimatedCost)
Bud --> Eng : ledger updated
Eng -> Store : save(EvaluationRun status=admitted)
Eng -> RSM : transition planned→admitted
Eng --> Op : { run, admittedToken }
deactivate Eng

== E5 · executeAttempt ==

Op -> Eng : executeAttempt(runId, caseRef, seed)
activate Eng
Eng -> RSM : admitted→queued→leased→running
Eng -> Runner : execute(config)
Runner --> Eng : outputRefs · tokenUsage · cost
Eng -> Store : saveAttempt(RunAttempt)
Eng --> Op : RunAttempt(succeeded)
deactivate Eng

alt attempt failed
  Eng -> Store : saveAttempt(status=failed)
  note right of Eng: retry = new attempt\nnever overwrite
end

== E5 · completeRun ==

Op -> Eng : completeRun(runId)
Eng -> RSM : running→collecting
Eng -> Bud : reconcileBudget(actual)
Eng -> Store : save(run status=collecting)

== E6 · scoring + decision (external pipeline) ==

Op -> Score : observe + aggregate
Score -> Dec : evaluateDecision
Dec --> Op : ClaimDecision(supported/notSupported/inconclusive)

note over Op, Conf #F7F3EC
  ClaimDecision 发布须：
  ① 无 blocking guardrail violations
  ② reviewerAttestations 满 quorum + role
  ③ evidenceRoot ≠ empty
  ④ signatureRefs ≠ empty
end note

footer 类型 05A · 状态 05C · 目录 05E · 理论 05F

@enduml
